# This directory holds the bundled web frontend.
#
# The frontend itself (HTML/CSS/JS) is owned by the frontend agent and lives
# in /workspace/frontend/. It is copied here by scripts/build_android.sh at
# build time so the Android WebView shell can load it offline from
# file:///android_asset/web/index.html.
#
# Do not edit files in this directory by hand; re-run build_android.sh after
# changing the frontend.
